START array 3 0 indicates an array with 3 columns,  and  0  spare
disks.   Old configurations specified a 3rd value in front of the
number of columns and spare disks.  This old value, if  provided,
must be specified as 1: START array 1 3 0 The second section, the
section,  specifies the actual components of the device.  For ex‐
